raph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"CustomEvent.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"CustomEvent"}]},{"type":"text","value":"."},{"type":"link","href":"CustomEvent.md#metadata","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"metadata"}]}]},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"name","children":[{"type":"text","value":"name"}]},{"type":"code","value":"name: \"structured-output.start\";","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L1547","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/ai/src/types.ts:1547"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"What this custom event is. Required: without it a consumer cannot route\nthe value."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"overrides","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Overrides"}]},{"type":"code","value":"CustomEvent.name","lang":"ts"},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"type","children":[{"type":"text","value":"type"}]},{"type":"code","value":"type: \"CUSTOM\";","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L1509","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/ai/src/types.ts:1509"}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"inherited-from-2","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Inherited from"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"CustomEvent.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"CustomEvent"}]},{"type":"text","value":"."},{"type":"link","href":"CustomEvent.md#type","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"type"}]}]},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"value","children":[{"type":"text","value":"value"}]},{"type":"code","value":"value: object;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L1548","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/ai/src/types.ts:1548"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The payload. Any JSON value, and required."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"messageid","children":[{"type":"text","value":"messageId"}]},{"type":"code","value":"messageId: string;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"overrides-2","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Overrides"}]},{"type":"code","value":"CustomEvent.value","lang":"ts"}],"headings":[{"id":"extends","text":"Extends","level":2},{"id":"properties","text":"Properties","level":2},{"id":"metadata","text":"metadata?","level":3},{"id":"inherited-from","text":"Inherited from","level":4},{"id":"name","text":"name","level":3},{"id":"overrides","text":"Overrides","level":4},{"id":"type","text":"type","level":3},{"id":"inherited-from-2","text":"Inherited from","level":4},{"id":"value","text":"value","level":3},{"id":"messageid","text":"messageId","level":4},{"id":"overrides-2","text":"Overrides","level":4}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:1546](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L1546)\n\nEmitted at the start of a streaming structured-output run, before the JSON\ndeltas. Tells consumers that the upcoming `TEXT_MESSAGE_CONTENT` deltas\nbelong to a structured response so they can route those bytes into a\n`StructuredOutputPart` instead of building a `TextPart`. Carries the\n`messageId` the deltas will be tagged with so the routing decision can be\nmade per-message rather than globally.\n\n## Extends\n\n- [`CustomEvent`](CustomEvent.md)\n\n## Properties\n\n### metadata?\n\n```ts\noptional metadata?: Record<string, any>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:1510](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L1510)\n\nExtra information attached to this event.\n\n#### Inherited from\n\n[`CustomEvent`](CustomEvent.md).[`metadata`](CustomEvent.md#metadata)\n\n***\n\n### name\n\n```ts\nname: \"structured-output.start\";\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:1547](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L1547)\n\nWhat this custom event is. Required: without it a consumer cannot route\nthe value.\n\n#### Overrides\n\n```ts\nCustomEvent.name\n```\n\n***\n\n### type\n\n```ts\ntype: \"CUSTOM\";\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:1509](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L1509)\n\n#### Inherited from\n\n[`CustomEvent`](CustomEvent.md).[`type`](CustomEvent.md#type)\n\n***\n\n### value\n\n```ts\nvalue: object;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:1548](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L1548)\n\nThe payload. Any JSON value, and required.\n\n#### messageId\n\n```ts\nmessageId: string;\n```\n\n#### Overrides\n\n```ts\nCustomEvent.value\n```\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: StructuredOutputStartEvent\ntitle: StructuredOutputStartEvent\n---\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:1546](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L1546)\n\nEmitted at the start of a streaming structured-output run, before the JSON\ndeltas. Tells consumers that the upcoming `TEXT_MESSAGE_CONTENT` deltas\nbelong to a structured response so they can route those bytes into a\n`StructuredOutputPart` instead of building a `TextPart`. Carries the\n`messageId` the deltas will be tagged with so the routing decision can be\nmade per-message rather than globally.\n\n## Extends\n\n- [`CustomEvent`](CustomEvent.md)\n\n## Properties\n\n### metadata?\n\n```ts\noptional metadata?: Record<string, any>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:1510](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L1510)\n\nExtra information attached to this event.\n\n#### Inherited from\n\n[`CustomEvent`](CustomEvent.md).[`metadata`](CustomEvent.md#metadata)\n\n***\n\n### name\n\n```ts\nname: \"structured-output.start\";\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:1547](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L1547)\n\nWhat this custom event is. Required: without it a consumer cannot route\nthe value.\n\n#### Overrides\n\n```ts\nCustomEvent.name\n```\n\n***\n\n### type\n\n```ts\ntype: \"CUSTOM\";\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:1509](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L1509)\n\n#### Inherited from\n\n[`CustomEvent`](CustomEvent.md).[`type`](CustomEvent.md#type)\n\n***\n\n### value\n\n```ts\nvalue: object;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:1548](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L1548)\n\nThe payload. Any JSON value, and required.\n\n#### messageId\n\n```ts\nmessageId: string;\n```\n\n#### Overrides\n\n```ts\nCustomEvent.value\n```\n"}
